# Build context filter for the .NET service images (context = repo root,
# dockerfile = deploy/dotnet.Dockerfile). Keeps the context small and stops
# local bin/obj and node_modules from leaking into image layers.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml
Jenkinsfile
sonar-project.properties
docker-compose.yml
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
src/Corridor.Spa/dist
docs
screenshots
scripts
deploy
db
postman
soapui
jmeter
tests
e2e
*.md
